WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.198
Today we will share artworks with an audience. Our work connects with other Ghanaian

00:00:05.198 --> 00:00:05.555
communities.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:09.119
Choose finished works and give each a title label.

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:13.204
Place the works where viewers can see them without crowding.

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:19.151
Guide visitors to observe one artwork and ask a respectful question. Compare your

00:00:19.151 --> 00:00:21.727
result with a second example from Ghana.
